async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/(workspace)/(main)/create/error-dd96ec7193b5c84e.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3440-5006646a4413f9df.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/(workspace)/(main)/layout-feace89670507915.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/6434-0c05ee508856ac07.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2180-7af403690f1bd7cb.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/6930-4425563ad5b67fac.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/9852-bbabe2ab706cce05.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/6533-1a8e29e09fbaaef6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3859-f35e1027b2fc4fbe.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/954-668dd685e5003905.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/6032-f8462006050261ab.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/(workspace)/layout-2f86c8204a8af7bc.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/global-error-17800356a3bc8331.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2106-9d134812899139b1.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/layout-7b888a7ba501c8c9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/(workspace)/create/loading-22352cb06b842b9c.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/error-c4f3399a14980e71.js" async=""></script><link rel="preload" href="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-ZJBV7VYP55" as="script"/><link rel="preload" href="https://s.yimg.jp/images/listing/tool/cv/ytag.js" as="script"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" type="image/png"/><title>Effortless AI Video Generation from Simple Text and Image Prompts | Vidu AI</title><meta name="description" content="Effortlessly generate engaging videos using Vidu&#x27;s world top AI video generation platform in seconds. Let us bring your vision to life fast and easy."/><meta name="application-name" content="Vidu AI"/><meta name="keywords" content="AI Video, Text-to-Video, Image-to-Video, Character-to-Video, Video Consistency, Vidu, Vidu AI, Video Generation, Shengshu Vidu, Vidu Model, Vidu, Vidu AI"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.vidu.com/create"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://www.vidu.com/create"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://www.vidu.com/create"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="zh" href="https://www.vidu.com/zh/create"/><link rel="icon" href="/logo.svg"/><meta name="next-size-adjust"/><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Vidu","url":"https://www.vidu.com/","logo":"https://www.vidu.com/logo.svg","sameAs":["https://x.com/ViduAI_official","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChF9964qVeqdSL9MkzBwCig","https://www.tiktok.com/@vidu_ai?lang=en","https://discord.gg/3pDU8fmQ8Y","https://www.instagram.com/vidu.studio2024"]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Vidu?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vidu is a cutting-edge AI video generator that transforms text and images into high-quality videos, supporting multiple creation modes: Text to Video, Image to Video, and Reference to Video. Designed for independent creators and teams, Vidu simplifies the production of high-quality videos, 2D animations, and diverse artistic styles, empowering users to bring their creative visions to life effortlessly.With robust semantic understanding and fast generation speed, Vidu eliminates production complexities, allowing creators to focus solely on their ideas. From low resolution to stunning 1080p outputs, Vidu offers unmatched flexibility and efficiency, providing a broader canvas for creativity."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the use of Vidu AI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vidu AI is a powerful tool for creating high-quality AI-generated videos with exceptional consistency and fast generation speed. It is widely used across various industries, from social media content creation to professional video production and commercial advertising. Many creators use Vidu AI to produce viral videos like kissing, hugging, or fighting clips.Film studios and animation teams leverage it for studio-level 2D animations and cinematic content. Businesses also use Vidu AI to enhance marketing videos, such as image-to-video to animate product images or reference-to-video to change ad backgrounds, making video advertisements more dynamic and engaging.With its advanced AI capabilities, Vidu AI streamlines video production for creators, studios, and businesses."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's the difference between Vidu's Reference to Video and Image to Video?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vidu's Image-to-Video feature allows users to create AI-generated videos from a static image, bringing them to life with motion and animation. Users can also set the first and last frames of their AI video. It streamlines the video or animation creation process—often leading to surprising and creative resultsReference to Video lets users upload three or more images of an object, character, or scene as references, and Vidu can combine elements into a seamless video based on a prompt. Vidu's Reference to Video also supports uploading different angles of a character or object to ensure consistency. The Reference-to-Video feature is ideal for maintaining consistency and seamlessly generating videos that blend multiple visual references."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Vidu AI free to use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All users receive a set amount of free credits to generate videos at no cost."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Vidu AI safe to use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Vidu AI is completely safe to use. We prioritize user data security and privacy, ensuring all uploaded content remains confidential. Vidu does not use user-uploaded data for AI training, nor do we share or leak personal information. Our system is designed with robust security measures to protect your data at all times."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I reach out if I have more questions about Vidu?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If you have additional questions about Vidu, you can: Join our Discord community at https://discord.gg/3pDU8fmQ8Y to connect with our team and other users for real-time support and updates. Visit our Help Center for answers and support."}}]}</script><script type="text/javascript">window.__APP_CONFIG__ = {"guest_mode":"on"};</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="__variable_49636d __variable_26649f __variable_6a4621"><!--$--><div class="relative min-h-screen w-screen font-ShengShu"><header class="relative z-30 flex h-[80px] w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-[#FFFFFF99] text-base data-[open=true]:bg-[rgba(19,12,20,0.8)] md:h-16 md:p-4"><div class="inline-flex items-center font-bold text-3xl hover:cursor-pointer sm:flex-1"><a target="_self" href="/en/create"><svg width="3.4881889763779528em" height="1em" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 443 137" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_192_1879)"><path d="M145.98 1.83999C125.33 -5.00001 107.57 9.50999 103.43 22.79C103.43 22.79 88.53 70.64 82.18 90.61C79.15 100.13 71.64 115.72 57.5 115.72C45.98 115.72 40.06 104.91 37.56 98.47L20.39 52.69C18.4 47.87 20.48 38.25 28.46 35.37C36.98 32.31 42.46 39.44 43.88 43.22L65.27 98.02C70.37 91.45 73.61 80.76 75.72 73.19L61.67 36.31C55.01 19.1 37.4 11.28 21.08 17.29C7.85998 22.16 -4.86002 38.84 2.05998 59.8L19.78 105.38C22.47 112.29 33.1 134.85 57.12 134.85C85.95 134.85 96.77 110.27 102.77 90.84C105.77 81.12 122.23 28.57 122.23 28