tion Deleted\",\"content\":\"This creation has been deleted.\"},\"canceled\":{\"title\":\"Task Canceled\",\"content\":\"Your task has been canceled, and the credits have been returned.\"}},\"action\":{\"recreate\":\"Recreate\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"report\":\"Feedback\",\"delete\":\"Delete\",\"submit\":\"Submit\",\"submitted\":\"Submitted\",\"reprompt\":\"Reprompt\"},\"empty\":\"Start creating your first video now!\",\"audioEmpty\":\"All tasks are complete.Great job!\",\"allLoaded\":\"Fully loaded\",\"toTop\":\"Top\",\"filterProcessing\":\"Processing\"},\"create\":{\"tabInput\":\"Input\",\"tabSettings\":\"Settings\",\"tabImg2Video\":\"Image to Video\",\"tabCharacter2Video\":\"Reference to Video\",\"tabText2Video\":\"Text to Video\",\"tabText2VideoTooltip\":\"Text-to-Video isn't available in Vidu 2.0 yet. Switch to Vidu 1.5 now.\",\"tabScene\":\"Templates\",\"text2Audio\":\"AI Sound Effects\",\"back\":\"Cancel\",\"enhance\":{\"text\":\"Enhance prompt\",\"tip\":\"Once enabled, your prompts will be automatically optimized to enhance the generation results. If you prefer greater control over the generated videos, it is recommended not to enable this feature.\"},\"img2VideoForm\":{\"input\":{\"placeholder\":\"Based on the images, describe the content you want to generate.\"},\"imageError\":\"Failed to load image {index}, please remove and re-upload\"},\"char2VideoForm\":{\"multiImageBoost\":{\"name\":\"What is reference to video\",\"tip\":\"Add one or more images of the subject to generate a consistent video.\"},\"input\":{\"placeholder\":{\"default\":\"Upload a picture of your subject and enter your text to start creating the video. The video will focus on the main subject of your images!\",\"multiImageBoost\":\"Upload one or more characters, objects, or scenes as references, describe the content you want to generate.\",\"noGuide\":\"Upload one or more characters, objects, or scenes as references, describe the content you want to generate.\"}},\"error\":{\"forbiddenReference\":\"Private references cannot be used. Please replace it with your own images/references.\",\"uploadingReference\":\"Image uploading, please wait for the image to upload before submitting\"},\"inspire\":\"Try Samples\",\"userGuide\":\"User Guide\",\"video\":{\"error\":\"Failed to load video\"},\"imageError\":\"Failed to load image {index}, please remove and re-upload\",\"element\":{\"saveToElement\":\"Save to My References\",\"saveToElementTip\":\"Saving helps you reuse it easily and improves generation quality.\",\"addElements\":\"My References\",\"addElementsShort\":\"References\",\"addImages\":\"Images\",\"uploadImages\":\"Upload images\",\"chooseElements\":\"Choose References\"},\"tour\":{\"step1\":{\"title\":\"Save to My References\",\"description\":\"Save frequently used images to My References for convenient future use\"},\"step2\":{\"title\":\"Boost Creation Efficiency\",\"description\":\"When creating, you can directly select references, or simply type @ followed by the reference's name in the prompt field to select it\"},\"step3\":{\"title\":\"Better Video Results\",\"description\":\"The characteristics of people, objects, or scenes saved to My References will remain more stable\"}},\"welcome\":{\"title\":\"Generate Videos with\",\"titleHighlight\":\"Multi-Reference Consistency\",\"description\":\"You can upload 1 to 7 references from your images or from the references you have already saved.\"},\"dialog\":{\"confirmButtonText\":\"Got it\",\"maxReferenceError\":{\"content\":\"Max {count} images/references allowed. You’ve selected more than {count}. Please reselect.\",\"confirmButtonText\":\"OK\"},\"elementModified\":{\"content\":\"References changed. Recreating the video will use the latest updates.\",\"closeButtonText\":\"Don't show again\"},\"deleteConfirm\":{\"content\":\"Deleting “@” and its reference will be also unselected. Proceed?\",\"closeButtonText\":\"Cancel\",\"confirmButtonText\":\"Got it, unselect\"}},\"elementForbidden\":{\"tooltip\"