m limit({limit}). Please shrink your image or choose another to create.\",\"invalidRatio\":\"Your uploaded image is too long or too wide. Please crop or choose another image to create.\",\"invalidImage\":\"The browser does not support the image. Please try another image.\",\"invalidArea\":\"Your uploaded image is too small. Please choose another image to create.\"},\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"confirm\":\"Confirm\"},\"submit\":\"Create\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Settings\",\"modelVersion\":{\"title\":\"Model Version\"},\"style\":{\"title\":\"Style\",\"tip\":\"Select the video style, available for text-to-video only.\",\"optionGeneral\":{\"text\":\"General\"},\"optionAnime\":{\"text\":\"Animation\"}},\"duration\":{\"title\":\"Duration\",\"tip\":\"Support 4s/8s video creation. Longer videos will require more time to generate.\",\"unSupportToast\":\"The current mode only supports 720p\",\"option\":{\"text\":\"{time} Seconds\",\"shortText\":\"{time}s\"}},\"aspectRatio\":{\"title\":\"Aspect Ratio\"},\"model\":{\"title\":\"Resolution\",\"tip\":\"Speed: faster generation speed\\nStandard: better image quality\",\"optionSpeed\":{\"text\":\"Speed\"},\"optionStandard\":{\"text\":\"Standard\"}},\"resolution\":{\"title\":\"Resolution\",\"tip\":\"Choose higher resolution for better video quality, but be aware it may take longer to process.\",\"unSupportToast\":\"The current mode only supports 4 seconds\",\"option512\":{\"text\":\"Speed\"},\"option720p\":{\"text\":\"720p\",\"tooltip\":\"Your exclusive 720p HD experience is ready! You have {count} chance{s} left — upgrade for unlimited HD access.\"},\"option1080p\":{\"text\":\"1080p\"}},\"movementAmplitude\":{\"title\":\"Movement Amplitude\",\"tip\":\"Auto: Fits your prompt automatically\\nSmall / Medium / Large: Manual amplitude selection\",\"optionAuto\":{\"text\":\"Auto\"},\"optionSmall\":{\"text\":\"Small\"},\"optionMedium\":{\"text\":\"Medium\"},\"optionLarge\":{\"text\":\"Large\"}},\"amount\":{\"title\":\"Amount\",\"feature\":\"